      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T09:54:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, it doesn\u0027t work, because when we enter S0ix and resume form S0ix, the `S0_exit` and `S0_entry` won\u0027t trigger, so we need keep original set in chipset.",
